<div class="list-pages-item">


<p><iframe src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00296/?theme_url=http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--code/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:_theme/1" align="" frameborder="0" height="" scrolling="no" width="" class="" style="width:100%;height:26px;overflow:hidden"></iframe></p>
<p><strong>项目描述：</strong>一台X射线安检设备，有10%的概率会将放入其中的行李箱/包之间的行李进行交换。<br />
<strong>回收日期：</strong>2020/5/23<br />
<strong>回收地点：</strong>上海市[已编辑]地铁站的安检入口<br />
<strong>当前状态：</strong>被存放在Site-CN-33的异常物品收容单元中<br />
<strong>笔记：</strong><em>你能想象当你打开你的行李箱时，发现里面的各种文件全他妈变成了化妆品和bra的感受吗？！——愤怒的Bruce博士</em></p>
<div style="text-align: right;">
<p><span id="u-credit-00296" class="option-button fa fa-info-circle">信息</span><a class="option-button fa fa-edit" href="/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00296" target="_blank">编辑</a></p>
</div>
<div id="u-credit-00296-hovertip">
<p><strong>作者：</strong><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/brucewu0463" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(5526785); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5526785&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609487409" alt="BruceWu0463" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5526785)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/brucewu0463" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(5526785); return false;">BruceWu0463</a></span></p>
<p><strong>发布日期：</strong><span class="odate time_1593845195 format_%25Y-%25m-%25d">04 Jul 2020 06:46</span></p>
</div>
<hr />
</div>
<div class="list-pages-item">


<p><iframe src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00224/?theme_url=http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--code/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:_theme/1" align="" frameborder="0" height="" scrolling="no" width="" class="" style="width:100%;height:26px;overflow:hidden"></iframe></p>
<p><strong>项目描述：</strong>一张铁架床，当有人躺在项目上并且闭上眼睛时，此人将持续听见“嗡嗡”声当对象睁眼时异常性质消失<br />
<strong>回收日期：</strong>20██/██/██<br />
<strong>回收地点：</strong>Dr.pigeon的卧室中<br />
<strong>当前状态：</strong>放置于低价值异常物品收容室<br />
<strong>笔记：</strong><em>哪里有蚊子啊啊啊啊！搞得我一宿没睡觉啊啊啊啊！</em>——在卧室中喷了一整瓶花露水的Dr.pigeon</p>
<div style="text-align: right;">
<p><span id="u-credit-00224" class="option-button fa fa-info-circle">信息</span><a class="option-button fa fa-edit" href="/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00224" target="_blank">编辑</a></p>
</div>
<div id="u-credit-00224-hovertip">
<p><strong>作者：</strong><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/scorpionidaslaughter" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6306406); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6306406&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609487409" alt="ScorpionidaSlaughter" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6306406)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/scorpionidaslaughter" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6306406); return false;">ScorpionidaSlaughter</a></span></p>
<p><strong>发布日期：</strong><span class="odate time_1590860663 format_%25Y-%25m-%25d">30 May 2020 17:44</span></p>
</div>
<hr />
</div>
<div class="list-pages-item">


<p><iframe src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00211/?theme_url=http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--code/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:_theme/1" align="" frameborder="0" height="" scrolling="no" width="" class="" style="width:100%;height:26px;overflow:hidden"></iframe></p>
<p><strong>项目描述：</strong>项目为Site-CN-10厕所中的部分门锁。在有人进入时有一定几率自动反锁并一段时间内无法在保持锁体完好状况下使用外力打开，当进入对象进入极度绝望状态下将自动打开。<br />
<strong>回收日期：</strong>20██/██/██<br />
<strong>回收地点：</strong>Site-CN-10的厕所<br />
<strong>当前状态：</strong>已被更换<br />
<strong>笔记：</strong><em>我终于知道为什么站点里的女员工都会怪力了</em>——特工Accipiter</p>
<div style="text-align: right;">
<p><span id="u-credit-00211" class="option-button fa fa-info-circle">信息</span><a class="option-button fa fa-edit" href="/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00211" target="_blank">编辑</a></p>
</div>
<div id="u-credit-00211-hovertip">
<p><strong>作者：</strong><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/dr-aurora-owl" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6126100); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6126100&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609487409" alt="Dr Aurora Owl" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6126100)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/dr-aurora-owl" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6126100); return false;">Dr Aurora Owl</a></span></p>
<p><strong>发布日期：</strong><span class="odate time_1589848038 format_%25Y-%25m-%25d">19 May 2020 00:27</span></p>
</div>
<hr />
</div>
<div class="list-pages-item">


<p><iframe src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00015/?theme_url=http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--code/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:_theme/1" align="" frameborder="0" height="" scrolling="no" width="" class="" style="width:100%;height:26px;overflow:hidden"></iframe></p>
<p><strong>项目描述：</strong>一张Site-CN-02全体在任研究员的集体合影，其中出现了多名拍摄时已殉职的研究员。需要注意的是，尽管该合影当时曾印制多份并发配给全体参与拍摄的研究员手中，但只有研究员Misaki所持有的这份出现该异常。<br />
<strong>回收日期：</strong>20██/██/██<br />
<strong>回收地点：</strong>研究员Misaki的私人住宅内<br />
<strong>当前状态：</strong>由研究员Misaki私人所持有<br />
<strong>笔记：</strong><em>怎么搞的，针对我是吧，又不是我害死你们的</em>——研究员Misaki</p>
<div style="text-align: right;">
<p><span id="u-credit-00015" class="option-button fa fa-info-circle">信息</span><a class="option-button fa fa-edit" href="/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00015" target="_blank">编辑</a></p>
</div>
<div id="u-credit-00015-hovertip">
<p><strong>作者：</strong><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/miku1314" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(4546338); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=4546338&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609487409" alt="miku1314" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=4546338)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/miku1314" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(4546338); return false;">miku1314</a></span></p>
<p><strong>发布日期：</strong><span class="odate time_1585806968 format_%25Y-%25m-%25d">02 Apr 2020 05:56</span></p>
</div>
<hr />
</div>
    
